                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c4y8MREYzkPrdOut27fu-123" value="4. A* search finds: A→sync, B→sync, C→model move (C is not in trace → skip on model)&#xa;&#xa;We observe \( n_1(A) \) \( n_1(B)\). Then we observe \(n_3(D)\).  To traverse \( n_1 \rightarrow n_3\) (Defined by the Entrypoint C in \( n_3\)) we need to the trace \( n_1(A), n_1(C) \) to get to \( n_3 \)" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1034.5" y="1130" width="201" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="c4y8MREYzkPrdOut27fu-124" value="5. Returns AlignmentResponse: alignment = [A↔A, B↔B, C↔&gt;&gt;] (cost = 1 model move)" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
